flowchart TD
    Start([Receive Candidate Document Chunks]) --> ExtractScores[Extract Vector Similarity Score: S_vec]
    ExtractScores --> Tokenize[Tokenize & Clean Query and Chunk Snippet Text]
    Tokenize --> FilterStops[Filter Standard Low-Value Stop Words]
    
    FilterStops --> MatchTerms[Compute Query Term Matches in Snippet & Title]
    MatchTerms --> CoverageRatio[Calculate Term Coverage Ratio: C = matched / total_query_terms]
    MatchTerms --> TermFreq[Count Total Frequency of Matched Terms]
    TermFreq --> DensityScore["Compute Term Density: D = min(1.0, ln(1 + freq) / 3.0)"]
    
    CoverageRatio --> LexicalFormula["Compute Lexical Match Score: S_lex = round(0.7 * C + 0.3 * D, 3)"]
    DensityScore --> LexicalFormula
    
    LexicalFormula --> CompositeFormula["Calculate Composite Score: S_comp = (0.6 * S_vec) + (0.4 * S_lex) + TitleBonus"]
    CompositeFormula --> Deduplicate[Deduplicate Overlapping Chunks from Identical Section]
    Deduplicate --> SortCandidates[Sort Candidates Descending by S_comp]
    SortCandidates --> SelectTopK[Select Top K Chunks, default=5]
    
    SelectTopK --> EvaluateMax{Max Score S_max >= 0.65?}
    EvaluateMax -- Yes --> HighQual[Evidence Quality = HIGH]
    EvaluateMax -- No --> EvalMed{Max Score S_max >= 0.45?}
    EvalMed -- Yes --> MedQual[Evidence Quality = MEDIUM]
    EvalMed -- No --> EvalLow{Max Score S_max >= 0.25?}
    EvalLow -- Yes --> LowQual[Evidence Quality = LOW]
    EvalLow -- No --> InsuffQual[Evidence Quality = INSUFFICIENT]

    HighQual --> OutputEvidence([Return Top Evidence & Quality Indicator])
    MedQual --> OutputEvidence
    LowQual --> OutputEvidence
    InsuffQual --> OutputEvidence
